| 2 | `node -e "require('./bridge/state/gate-telemetry').emit('slice-archived', {})"` exits 0. |
| 3 | Any pre-existing gate-telemetry tests pass. |
| 4 | No other files modified. |
| 5 | DONE report shows the diff + a one-line confirm of AC #2. |

